<view class="page"><view class="title">发现科研好仪器</view><view class="subtitle">未来14天机时在线可查 · 半小时灵活预约</view><view wx:if="!approved" class="notice">实名审核中，审核完成后即可使用预约服务。</view><input placeholder="搜索仪器名称、型号或编号" confirm-type="search" bindconfirm="search"/><view wx:for="items" wx:key="id" class="card"><view class="row"><text class="tag">{{item.category}}</text><text class="subtitle">{{item.status==='Open'?'开放中':'维保停用'}}</text></view><view class="title" style="font-size:32rpx">{{item.name}}</view><view class="subtitle">{{item.model}} · {{item.location}}</view><view class="price">校内 ¥{{item.price}} / h</view><view class="subtitle">校外 ¥{{item.external_price}} / h</view><button class="primary" disabled="{{item.status!=='Open'}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="book">查看机时</button></view><view wx:if="!items.length&&approved" class="empty">暂无匹配仪器，请调整搜索条件。</view></view>
